# Privacy Policy for FinPlan

**Last updated:** July 31, 2026

---

## Introduction

We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how FinPlan ("we", "our", or "us") collects, uses, stores, and protects your information when you use our mobile application.

---

## 1. Information We Collect

To provide you with the core functionality of personal finance tracking, we collect and process the following information:

### Account & Authentication Data
- Email address
- Unique User ID (UID)
- Basic authentication details

### Financial & Budgeting Data
- Transaction records
- Income and expense amounts
- Custom category names
- Account names
- Dates entered manually by you

### Technical & Diagnostic Data
- IP address
- Device model
- Operating system version
- System performance logs (collected automatically via Firebase services to ensure app stability)

**Note:** We do NOT collect bank account numbers, IBANs, credit card numbers, government IDs, or sensitive personal identity information.

---

## 2. How We Use Your Information

We use the collected information solely for the following purposes:

- To create and maintain your personal user account
- To synchronize, display, and calculate your personal financial budget across your logged-in devices
- To diagnose technical issues, fix bugs, and ensure system security

**We do NOT sell, rent, trade, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing or advertising purposes.**

---

## 3. Data Storage, Security & International Transfers

Your data is stored securely using **Google Firebase infrastructure** (Firebase Authentication and Cloud Firestore) hosted on secure servers located in the United States.

Google Firebase complies with international security standards:
- ISO/IEC 27001
- SOC 1/2/3
- EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework

We implement industry-standard encryption protocols (in transit via HTTPS/TLS and at rest) to safeguard your information.

---

## 4. Account Deletion and Your Rights (GDPR)

Under applicable privacy laws (including GDPR), you have the right to access, update, or delete your personal data at any time.

**Account Deletion:** You can request or perform complete deletion of your account and all associated financial records by:
- Selecting "Delete Account" directly within the App settings, or
- Contacting us at: **tslotmidav@gmx.at**

---

## 5. Third-Party Services

Our application utilizes infrastructure services provided by **Google LLC:**

- **Firebase Authentication** — For secure user login
- **Cloud Firestore** — For cloud storage and synchronization of your budgeting data

For more information on how Google handles data, please review [Google's Privacy & Terms](https://policies.google.com/privacy).

---

## 6. Children's Privacy

Our application is not directed to individuals under the age of 13 (or 16 in certain EU jurisdictions). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

